+/*
+ * PORT 7.0.12: ported from the Sophgo/CVITEK Linux 5.10 vendor tree
+ * (originally sdhci-cv.c / multi-SoC sdhci-cvi.o composite) to build as a
+ * single standalone in-tree object 'sdhci-cv181x.o' against mainline
+ * Linux 7.0.x.  All behavioural changes are marked "PORT 7.0.12:".  The
+ * SDIO probe / reset / set_clock / set_ios / voltage / tuning paths are
+ * preserved byte-for-byte in behaviour; only card-detect-GPIO, eMMC
+ * HW-reset-by-GPIO and proc-stats plumbing that has no clean mainline
+ * equivalent (and is not needed for the AIC8800 SDIO wifi bring-up) has
+ * been stubbed.
+ */
